==============================================================================
  (m,n)=(13,8): при t=1  c0=c4=c8=233  (mod 8 = 1),  c2=(m-n)^2=25, c6=(m+n)^2=441
  (m,n)=(15,8): при t=1  c0=c4=c8=289  (mod 8 = 1),  c2=(m-n)^2=49, c6=(m+n)^2=529
